Description: Lightweight system monitoring with web dashboard
 system-monitor is a cross-platform monitoring service with a Russian-language
 web UI. Sensors, charts, and thresholds are configured via YAML or the web
 settings page. Metrics are stored in SQLite with automatic retention cleanup.
